      "id": 1,
      "text": "Jenkins was founded in 1911 by the Consolidation Coal Company, incorporated a year later, and named after company director George C.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        6,
        18,
        21,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
